actual_tool_parameters.prompt:
Create a new clean JAPANESE ANIME CEL-COLOUR PRODUCT BREAKDOWN board of ONE PAIR OF SIMPLE ROUNDED STRAP GOGGLES, white landscape background. Objects ONLY, NO human head/body, no hair in final drawing. References are actual wearing crops only for the selected frame outline, colours, TWO small orange side connection/adjustment clips, and ONE circumferential elastic strap. Ignore the character/hair visible in references.
A gentle rounded narrow WHITE frame, ONE continuous smoky dark lens with a low rounded nose relief, slim CHARCOAL soft gasket behind frame, ONE slender BLACK ELASTIC strap connecting directly to the left/right frame ends through TWO small orange connector/adjuster parts. No hard temple arms, hinges, top headband, rabbit ears/clips, earphones/pads, rear buckle, microphone, screws or imaginary mechanisms. White-black-orange clean hard-edged cel planes, dark linework, no glossy 3D/airbrush/grain.
LAYOUT MUST CLEARLY SEPARATE assembled reference from exploded components, with generous white margins. TOP small zone titled ASSEMBLED: 3 views of the complete same goggles (front, right profile, rear three-quarter showing the single strap loop). These are repeat VIEWS, not additional pieces. Frame proportions/nose contour/2 orange side parts match all views, and each front/side joining is structurally continuous. Side strap attaches DIRECTLY, not through a long arm.
BOTTOM main zone titled COMPONENTS: exactly SIX independent physical pieces only, arrayed with small labels 01–06:
01 one single continuous smoky lens, removed intact (not two eye lenses);
02 one thin white FRAME ONLY, hollow/empty inside where lens was removed;
03 one charcoal soft face GASKET ring, hollow/empty inside, no lens or white frame left inside;
04 ONE black flexible elastic strap as a single long curved strip with two terminal ends, no duplicate loop elsewhere in this components zone, no rear buckle;
05 one small LEFT orange connector/adjuster with dark backing;
06 its matching RIGHT orange connector/adjuster with dark backing.
The dark backings belong to 05/06, do not scatter them as extra pieces. The strap is REMOVED from all other disassembled parts; no second strap remains connected to a partially assembled body. No attached orange clips also remain on bare frame when the same clips are laid out as05/06. Thus the six separated parts add up exactly to the assembled object. You may add very restrained thin exploded alignment guides, but no intricate mechanisms and no leftover ghosts in empty frame/gasket openings.
Only short ASSEMBLED / COMPONENTS and 01–06 labels, no dimensions/manufacturing claims/long explanations/new logo. Fully new board; no local image manipulation.
